"""
cm-discover — ChordMaster Keymap Discoverer

Scans local config files and generates chordmaster-compatible JSON keymaps.

Supported sources:
  tmux    ~/.tmux.conf, ~/.config/tmux/tmux.conf
  vscode  ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/keybindings.json
          ~/.config/Code/User/keybindings.json (Linux)

Usage:
  cm-discover                        # discover all, write to ./keymaps/
  cm-discover --source tmux          # only tmux
  cm-discover --source vscode        # only VS Code
  cm-discover --out /path/to/dir     # custom output directory
  cm-discover --list                 # show what would be discovered, no output
  cm-discover --dry-run              # parse and preview, no files written
"""

